{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-139257-r4615188","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Honey Apple Glazed Pork","sourcePageId":139257,"sourceRevision":"4615188","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2026-02-03T02:35:16Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Honey%20Apple%20Glazed%20Pork&oldid=4615188","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:05:25.425Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Holiday recipes","Category:Inexpensive recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for spice mixes","Category:Recipes using apple","Category:Recipes using applesauce","Category:Recipes using cooking spray","Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon","Category:Recipes using honey","Category:Recipes using mustard powder","Category:Recipes using pork","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Roasted recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"b515f02f72ee77ce07bb6fd6bcd9e6066e90b0002a5dbf53f3eb29b49303f67f","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__{{recipesummary|category=Pork recipes|servings=6|time=2 hours|difficulty=3}}\n{{recipe}}| [[Cookbook:Cuisine of the United States|American Cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Holiday Recipes|Holiday Recipes]] | [[Cookbook:Meat|Meats]]\n==Ingredients==\n\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 1½ [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* 1 teaspoon ground [[Cookbook:Mustard|mustard]]\n* ½ teaspoon dried [[Cookbook:Sage|sage]] leaves\n* 1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Pound|pound]] (about 1.5 [[Cookbook:Kilogram|kg]]) [[Cookbook:Pork|pork butt roast]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Applesauce|applesauce]]\n* ¼ teaspoon ground [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n* ⅓ cup [[Cookbook:Honey|honey]]\n* ¼ teaspoon ground [[Cookbook:Nutmeg|nutmeg]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to [[Cookbook:Oven_temperatures|325°F]] (about 165°C).\n# Mix together pepper, flour, mustard, sage, and salt to get a rub.\n# Apply rub to pork roast and set aside.\n# Line a [[Cookbook:Pots and Pans|roasting pan]] with [[Cookbook:Aluminium Foil|foil]] and spray with [[Cookbook:Cooking Spray|cooking spray]].\n# Place roast in pan and [[Cookbook:Bake|bake]] for 30 minutes.\n# Mix together applesauce, cinnamon, honey, and nutmeg as a glaze.\n# Remove roast from oven and spread with glaze.\n# Return glazed roast to oven and bake until you get an internal temperature of 165°F (74°C), about 50–60 minutes.\n\n== Notes, tips, and variations ==\n* Good with [[Cookbook:Sweet Potato|sweet potatoes]] and [[Cookbook:Green Beans|green beans]].\n\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes|Pork, Honey Apple Glazed]]\n[[Category:Roasted recipes|Pork, Honey Apple Glazed]]\n[[Category:Recipes for spice mixes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using apple]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]\n[[Category:Holiday recipes|Pork, Honey Apple Glazed]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pork]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using applesauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cooking spray]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mustard powder]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Honey Apple Glaze